# Both images build from the repository root (npm workspaces need the root
# lockfile), so everything here would otherwise be sent as build context:
# node_modules, the API venv, .git and the local design prototypes alone are
# over 900 MB. The Dockerfiles only copy package manifests, apps/web and
# apps/api/src.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.git
.github
.claude
.codegraph
.local-runtime
.playwright-cli
.playwright-mcp
docs
dist
output
apps/api/tests
apps/api/evals
apps/api/.data
apps/api/*.db
apps/web/dist
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
integrations
